feat: Add comprehensive architecture review and strategic roadmap

This commit adds a detailed architecture review (ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW.md) ba=
sed on MCP Builder best practices from Anthropic/Sergeilipiev methodology.

Key findings:
- MCP compliance score: 4/10 (critical gaps identified)
- Agent-centric design: 3/10 (needs improvement)
