- Insufficient tool descriptions (need comprehensive format)
- No response_format support (JSON/Markdown)
- No pagination implementation
- No character limits or truncation
- Zero test coverage

Strategic improvement roadmap:
- Phase 1: MCP Compliance (2-3 weeks, 60-80h) - CRITICAL
- Phase 2: Testing &amp; Quality (2-3 weeks, 60-100h) - HIGH PRIORITY
- Phase 3: Agent-Centric Enhancements (3-4 weeks, 80-120h)
- Phase 4: Security &amp; Production Hardening (2-3 weeks, 60-80h)
- Phase 5: Advanced Features (4-6 weeks, 120-200h)

Total estimated effort: 260-380 hours (~2-3 months)

