bject]"><code class=3D"language-markdown" node=3D"[object Object]"># MCP-SS=
H Server

&gt; Model Context Protocol server for managing SSH connections

## Features

- =E2=9C=85 Persistent SSH connections across chat sessions
- =E2=9C=85 Support for ed25519 and RSA keys
- =E2=9C=85 Circuit Breaker pattern for reliability
- =E2=9C=85 Exponential backoff for failed connections
- =E2=9C=85 Secure credential storage (macOS Keychain / Windows Credential =
Manager)
- =E2=9C=85 Connection grouping with tags
- =E2=9C=85 Batch operations across multiple servers
- =E2=9C=85 Health monitoring

## Installation

