<h2 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Design Patterns</h2>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">1. Circuit Breaker Pat=
tern</h3>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Problem:</strong> Failed connections consume resources
<strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Solution:</strong>=
 Fail fast when threshold reached</p>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">2. Exponential Backoff=
</h3>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Problem:</strong> Immediate retries overload failing servers
<strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Solution:</strong>=
 Progressive delays with jitter</p>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">3. Connection Pooling<=
/h3>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Problem:</strong> Creating connections is expensive
<strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Solution:</strong>=
 Reuse existing connections</p>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">4. Factory Pattern</h3=
>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Problem:</strong> Complex connection creation
<strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Solution:</strong>=
 Centralized creation logic</p>
<h2 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Security Model</h2>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Credential Storage</h3=
>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Private Keys:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Stored in LokiJS database</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">File permissions: 600</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">No encryption (OS-level protection)</li>
</ul>
<p node=3D"[object Object]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object=
 Object]">Passwords:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
<li node=3D"[object Object]">macOS: Keychain</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Windows: Credential Manager</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Linux: LokiJS (encrypted)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">MCP Protocol Security<=
/h3>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
<li node=3D"[object Object]">stdio communication (local only)</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">No network exposure</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Sandboxed by Claude Desktop</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Performance Characteri=
stics</h2>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Connection Time</h3>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Initial connection: 200-500ms</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Reused connection: &lt;10ms</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Failed connection (with circuit breaker): &lt;=
100ms</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Memory Usage</h3>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Per connection: ~2MB</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Database: ~100KB per 100 connections</li>
<li node=3D"[object Object]">Circuit breaker overhead: ~1KB per host</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"font-semibold" node=3D"[object Object]">Scalability</h3>
<ul class=3D"list-disc list-outside space-y-1 ml-6" node=3D"[object Object]=
">
