=F0=9F=8E=AF Advanced Connection Pooling: Configurable 7-100 connections wi=
th intelligent management

## Changes

### Connection Pool Manager
- =E2=9C=85 Created ConnectionPoolManager class with production-grade featu=
res
- =E2=9C=85 Configurable pool size: 7-100 (default: 10)
- =E2=9C=85 LRU eviction strategy for pool management
- =E2=9C=85 Health checks every 30s with auto-healing
- =E2=9C=85 Auto-reconnect on failure (max 3 attempts, 2s delay)
- =E2=9C=85 Dynamic scaling based on Netflix/Uber patterns (2025)
- =E2=9C=85 Real-time metrics for observability

### SSH Service Integration
- =E2=9C=85 Integrated pool into SSHService
- =E2=9C=85 Modified connect() to use pool.acquire()
- =E2=9C=85 Modified disconnect() with release/destroy modes
- =E2=9C=85 Added getPoolStats() for monitoring
- =E2=9C=85 Pool event listeners for logging
- =E2=9C=85 Graceful shutdown with pool.shutdown()

### Configuration (2025 Best Practices)
- =E2=9C=85 Keepalive: 60000ms (60s) - optimal for production
- =E2=9C=85 KeepAliveCountMax: 10 (increased from 3 for resilience)
- =E2=9C=85 Health check interval: 30s
- =E2=9C=85 Idle timeout: 5 minutes
- =E2=9C=85 All settings configurable via environment variables

