- =E2=9C=85 Documented default values and ranges
- =E2=9C=85 Organized by phase with clear sections

## Performance Features

**Connection Reuse:**
- Pool maintains up to 100 active connections
- LRU eviction when pool full
- Idle connection cleanup (5min timeout)

**Resilience:**
- Auto-reconnect with exponential backoff
- Health checks prevent stale connections
- Dynamic scaling based on load

**Monitoring:**
- Pool statistics: total/active/idle connections
- Usage metrics: acquired/released/created/destroyed
- Pool utilization percentage
- Average usage count per connection

