feat: Implement L1 Cache Manager (Phase 1.3)

=E2=9A=A1 In-Memory Caching: lru-cache v11 with intelligent command result =
caching

## Changes

### Cache Manager
- =E2=9C=85 Created CacheManager class with LRU eviction
- =E2=9C=85 lru-cache v11.2.2 (named export, 2025 best practice)
- =E2=9C=85 Max 10,000 items, TTL 60s (configurable)
- =E2=9C=85 Real-time hit/miss tracking
- =E2=9C=85 Cache statistics: hits, misses, sets, deletes, hit rate, utiliz=
ation
- =E2=9C=85 Helper methods for cache key generation

### SSHService Integration =20
- =E2=9C=85 Integrated cache into executeCommand()
- =E2=9C=85 Check cache before command execution
- =E2=9C=85 Set cache after successful commands (code =3D=3D=3D 0)
- =E2=9C=85 Smart filtering: exclude sudo/cd commands
- =E2=9C=85 Cache key includes: connectionId + command + cwd
- =E2=9C=85 getCacheStats() and clearCache() methods

### Configuration
- =E2=9C=85 CACHE_MAX_ITEMS: 10000 (default)
- =E2=9C=85 CACHE_TTL: 60000ms (60s default)
- =E2=9C=85 CACHE_ENABLE_STATS: true (default)
- =E2=9C=85 All configurable via environment variables

### Performance Features

**Optimizations (2025):**
- updateAgeOnGet: false (optimized for repeated gets)
- updateAgeOnHas: false (minimize eviction time)
- Named export only (no default, per lru-cache v11+)

**Cache Strategy:**
- Cache successful command results only
- Automatic expiration after TTL
- LRU eviction when max size reached

**Excluded from Cache:**
- sudo commands (contain passwords)
- cd commands (change state)
- Failed commands (code !=3D=3D 0)

### Cache Statistics Example

```javascript
{
  size: 450,           // Current items
  maxSize: 10000,      // Maximum items
  hits: 1250,          // Cache hits
  misses: 200,         // Cache misses
  sets: 200,           // Cache sets
  deletes: 0,          // Cache deletes
  hitRate: 86.21,      // 86.21% hit rate
  utilization: 4.50    // 4.50% utilization
}
```

## Expected Performance Impact

- **Cache Hit**: &lt; 1ms response time
- **Cache Miss**: Normal SSH execution time
- **Target Hit Rate**: 80%+ for repeated commands
- **Memory Usage**: ~1MB per 1000 cached items

## Testing Results
- =E2=9C=85 Server starts with CacheManager
- =E2=9C=85 Logs show cache initialization
- =E2=9C=85 Cache TTL 60s configured
- =E2=9C=85 Max 10,000 items configured

## Next Steps
- Phase 1.4: Monitoring (Pino + Prometheus)
- Phase 2: L2 Cache (Redis), Compression, Secrets
- Phase 3: Production Deployment (VPS + Traefik/Caddy)
