     - Docker Buildx with caching
     - Semantic versioning tags
     - SBOM generation (SPDX JSON)
     - Trivy vulnerability scanning
     - Test images on all architectures
     - Release assets creation
     - Optional Docker Hub publish
   - Security: SARIF upload to GitHub Security
   - Build cache: GitHub Actions cache (max mode)
