     - Bug Fixes (fix:)
     - Performance (perf:)
     - Documentation (docs:)
     - Other Changes (chore:, refactor:, etc.)
   - Pre-release detection (beta, alpha, rc)
   - Draft release support
   - Artifact retention: 90 days

